1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,250
You hired a person to be a cable.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,455
This job used to take a morning.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,633
Now it runs before you sit down.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,240
It pulls every invoice that is due today.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,793
