6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,955
Sends it from your own inbox.

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,446
Then logs the thread back to the sheet.

8
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,430
Forty-seven invoices chased.

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,686
No spreadsheet. No copy-paste.

10
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,480
A whole morning back, every week.

11
